{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 18,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.7160034179688,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "This document is the fourth edition of WHO policy guidelines on TB diagnosis. Compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.994499206542969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        83.16120147705078,
        305.1625671386719,
        96.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "the third edition, issued in 2024, this document:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.91321563720703,
        78.81909942626953,
        116.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        102.91321563720703,
        526.96435546875,
        116.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "is the first to combine guidance on diagnosis of TB infection, disease and drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        118.41321563720703,
        250.07009887695312,
        131.55821228027344
      ],
      "text": "into a single reference document;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.9132080078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        147.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        133.9132080078125,
        526.6559448242188,
        147.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "establishes two new classes of TB diagnostic technologies (for the initial detection of TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978679656982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        149.4132080078125,
        526.920166015625,
        162.55821228027344
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifampicin), which include tests previously recommended for use as individual",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        164.9132080078125,
        152.97540283203125,
        178.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "products; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.4132080078125,
        78.81909942626953,
        193.55821228027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        180.4132080078125,
        526.9642333984375,
        193.55821228027344
      ],
      "text": "outlines new recommendations on concurrent testing of respiratory and non-respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        195.9132080078125,
        526.9972534179688,
        209.05821228027344
      ],
      "text": "samples among adults and adolescents with HIV, children with HIV, and children without",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.4132080078125,
        244.43870544433594,
        224.55821228027344
      ],
      "text": "HIV or with unknown HIV status.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.9041290283203,
        499.1830749511719,
        266.1341247558594
      ],
      "text": "1.2. WHO TB diagnostic class determination and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.7040100097656,
        287.0784912109375,
        288.9339904785156
      ],
      "text": "product prequalification",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.5250244140625,
        526.9285278320312,
        309.6700439453125
      ],
      "text": "Over the past 16 years, WHO has endorsed a range of diagnostic technologies ( ). The  Table 1.1.1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94651985168457,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.5250244140625,
        526.9940185546875,
        323.6700439453125
      ],
      "text": "WHO assessment process for TB diagnostics has recently evolved to focus on evaluating classes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980181694030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.5250244140625,
        526.9656372070312,
        337.6700439453125
      ],
      "text": "of TB diagnostic technologies rather than specific products. Class determination is managed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.5250244140625,
        526.9508666992188,
        351.6700439453125
      ],
      "text": "by WHO/GTB for new diagnostic testing technologies, and it includes an evaluation of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.5250244140625,
        192.5030975341797,
        365.6700439453125
      ],
      "text": "following characteristics:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.27691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        385.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        372.27691650390625,
        391.1755676269531,
        385.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "purpose of use (i.e. detection of TB or drug-specific resistance);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.77691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        400.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        387.77691650390625,
        176.53599548339844,
        400.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "principle of action;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.27691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        416.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        403.27691650390625,
        327.2788391113281,
        416.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure and human resource requirements;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.77691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        431.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        418.77691650390625,
        421.0515441894531,
        431.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "complexity of the testing procedure and associated instrumentation;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.27691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        447.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        434.27691650390625,
        335.0582580566406,
        447.42193603515625
      ],
      "text": "reporting method (automated versus manual); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.77691650390625,
        78.81909942626953,
        462.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        449.77691650390625,
        516.3436889648438,
        462.92193603515625
      ],
      "text": "intended setting of use (e.g. reference or peripheral low-complexity, near point-of-care).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.6155090332031,
        526.6509399414062,
        489.7605285644531
      ],
      "text": "These characteristics are compared between the new technology and each of the existing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.1155090332031,
        526.9646606445312,
        505.2605285644531
      ],
      "text": "classes already recommended by WHO. When characteristics differ from existing classes, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.615478515625,
        526.9633178710938,
        520.760498046875
      ],
      "text": "new technology will undergo an evidence review as “first-in-class” via Pathway A (described",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.115478515625,
        526.53759765625,
        536.260498046875
      ],
      "text": "below). When characteristics match those of an existing class, the new technology will undergo",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96389102935791,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.615478515625,
        301.3351745605469,
        551.760498046875
      ],
      "text": "a “within-class” assessment (Pathway B below).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.1271362304688,
        174.6999053955078,
        580.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "1.2.1 Pathway A",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.7579956054688,
        526.7887573242188,
        603.9030151367188
      ],
      "text": "New technologies will require a Pathway A review if they differ from technologies in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.2579956054688,
        526.629150390625,
        619.4030151367188
      ],
      "text": "existing classes in terms of the characteristics listed above. Evidence synthesis and review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.7579956054688,
        524.4512939453125,
        634.9030151367188
      ],
      "text": "and development of recommendations will be conducted through the established WHO/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.2579956054688,
        526.6500854492188,
        650.4030151367188
      ],
      "text": "GTB guideline development process using the Grading of Recommendations Assessment,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.7579956054688,
        527.1014404296875,
        665.9030151367188
      ],
      "text": "Development and Evaluation (GRADE) methodology. If recommended by a GDG after evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967251777648926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.2579956054688,
        526.965576171875,
        681.4030151367188
      ],
      "text": "review, technologies will be referred for WHO prequalification assessment (as available). If a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.7579956054688,
        526.9645385742188,
        696.9030151367188
      ],
      "text": "prequalification assessment procedure is not available, the WHO/GTB recommendation will",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.2579956054688,
        517.1622924804688,
        712.4030151367188
      ],
      "text": "stand until the prequalification procedure becomes available and is successfully completed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.05839920043945,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
